{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_warmy_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_warmy_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Unfinished Ending",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_warmy_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ad53e5b1b4678d6e2f0663ab12d39e47d812db84e464ffe210bb53646e34ffa9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ai—yah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew... good, good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you okay, Warmy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, I'm fine! I caught the dish! And look at the bowls! They're all fine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, Nanna Radish Leaves. I just got this staff, so I'm not used to it yet, and I sometimes knock things over when I'm not paying attention."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl stands on her tiptoes to put the fallen plates and bowls back to where they belong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha, silly girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Remember? Back when you used to come to my place for cystymilk crisps, you needed a little stool to reach your bowl in the cupboard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come, let Nanna see. You've grown quite tall..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, I think so too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's see. Oh dear, your collar's got a snagged thread."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, you're right... I've been traveling for so long, I haven't even noticed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come, get changed. I'll patch this up for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's okay, Nanna. I can fix this myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look, I have my own little sewing kit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh*, you must've had it pretty hard on the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't you say in the letter that somebody moved into the room I was in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It feels like... not a lot has changed here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After you'd left, I did have a few young men move in. Haven't you heard that they found a new area rich in minerals in the next town over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just like you, the kid who stayed here before simply left a letter and took off in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the matter? Have you talked to your Uncle Fat Head about staying here today? Hold on just a moment. I'll get your room ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's okay, Nanna. I'll be leaving again soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm back here this time because I wanted to see everybody again... including my dad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Button Shop Tailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I haven't heard anything about your father lately. Maybe you could try asking around. Somebody might just have heard something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep, it's okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And there's one other really important thing—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They'll play an outdoor movie at the rundown factory plot this evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why don't you come?! I'll pay for everyone's tickets!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g3_rmbttown"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Why are you laughing? I really will!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We actually made it through all kinds of danger and crossed a sandbeast's paradise that nobody knows about, and found a Feranmut nest there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are lots, lots, lots of really tall Originium crystals there... They're even taller than these tower cranes and furnaces!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah, good! I believe you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll tell all the workers how you visited that Blinking Valley place far, far away..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the Grinning Valley!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, right. The Grinning Valley!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've been traveling for so long, Warmy. I'm sure you've picked up plenty of new skills."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you know, I think it's good enough as long as you stay safe out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Remember to come back and visit more often."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm, but I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at this. What did I just tell you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I said I'd make this thing as good as new before you finished telling two stories, didn't I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now take this folding chair back to your nanna Radish Leaves! Tell her she could tap dance on the chair and it wouldn't break!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay! Thanks, Uncle Mustache!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? What else do you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's gonna be an outdoor movie screening this evening... Let's watch together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outdoor movie? Hah, no wonder she wanted to get this folding chair fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, then. I'll go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's been years since the last time I watched a movie. All they've been playing are those adventure flicks. That's what young people these days like, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Old folks like us prefer those slow-paced family films."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not at all. I love family movies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Back then... It was Daddy who asked me to watch movies with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I still remember how he would tear up whenever the relatives said goodbye to the main characters with smiles on their faces..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's even though he was a grown man."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your old man... right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's a sentimental one. We all know it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My kid—you know the one you called Screwhead—he went to the cities to study engineering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I couldn't leave for too long, because of my business. It was your old man who took him to school whenever it was time to go back... Remember?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep, I remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When I was small, every time he left for work, he'd bring me to your shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even though he told me he was going to the mines, I always asked you where he was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've always got on so well with your old man. *sigh* You really miss him, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mhm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard Screwhead's graduated, stayed in the city, and even got a good job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm so glad!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And I know my daddy would be really happy, too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good kid..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right... right. Your old man definitely knows. He doesn't talk much, but news always gets to him fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's probably working in some mine right now, with a lot of weight on his shoulders... I'm sure of it! I just hope their card games there aren't much different from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know when you two see each other again, he'll be very proud of what a big girl you've become!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, that big mining ship you're off to. Where's it headed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm... I'm not really sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lanns and Savage told me that I'm going to Rhodes Island to get treatm—No, that's not all. It's so I can learn lots and lots of new things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, but promise me this. Take care of yourself, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep... I will!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Construction Team Bricklayer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, Ol' Mustache! Here's your loudspeaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, got it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Loudspeaker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha, you've never seen such a strange looking trinket? It's one of the hottest products developed by Screwhead's company."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kid tells me it's got such a narrow, crooked neck because that's how it carries sound to far-off places."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, the workers here just use it to chitchat up on the scaffolding... but that ain't so bad, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uncle Mustache."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Repair Shop Machinist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_660_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is it okay if I borrow this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, everybody... Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Hello, everybody!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoa... Why is it so loud...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The workers, all dressed in a variety of outfits, look to the source of the sound.\nThey see a young girl with a loudspeaker poking her head through the rusted shutters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Hello, everybody! Tonight...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Tonight, let's watch an outdoor movie together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) At the same place as before, the rundown factory plot!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) A-And also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Remember not too eat too much for dinner. I'll have snacks for everyone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Inventory Keeper",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? There's a movie today? And snacks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Quality Checker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just the thing I need after spending all night inspecting galvanized steel!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Quality Checker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, lads, don't forget to grab a couple cases of fizzy drinks from the canteen!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Procurement Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, whose kid was that again? She's got a loud voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Auditor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I remember her... From the looks of it, she must've found her old man. Good. Good..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Porter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, so that's her... How long has she been gone? Two years? So it's been two years already...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Porter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah... two years, in the blink of an eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Technician",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh, it's like the blink of an eye to us alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Factory Technician",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I'm sure those same two years have been a very long time to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The factory workers keep piling into the empty plot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Everyone! The movie is about the start!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) If you have tall chairs, lean back as much as you can. If you have short ones, come as close to the front as possible to not block the people behind!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There are rows and rows of seats. Most have already taken settled in, while a few are trying to find a spot more to their liking.\nSome run up to the roof, some decide to dangle themselves from a crane, and some opt just to go to behind the silver screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "(Loudspeaker) Potlid—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "H-Hu-Huh?! Lanns?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no! I haven't turned the loudspeaker off yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Huh? Loudspeaker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "So everyone here heard my nickname for you loud and clear, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "How about it? Everyone thinks it's a great nickname, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*whimper*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Hello? Can anyone hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm never speaking to you again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Alright, alright. I'm sorry... I'm just worried about you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Didn't we agree you'd reach out to me as soon as you finished saying hi to the townspeople?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I got so busy that I forgot..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "What do I do with you...? Never mind. Are you happy you got to see everyone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yep, I'm very happy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Really, really happy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Haha, that's good. Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Warmy, the movie is about to start!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, coming!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Now off you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1183_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Finish saying all the things you've been holding in for the last couple years. We'll come to the town's station to pick you up tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lanns, I can go tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But... Would it be alright to have you pick me up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The workers keep their eyes focused on the screen. The protagonist's monologue is echoing in their ears."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh...? Is the movie over already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it kind of feels like the story's not over yet... What did the main character mean by that in the end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't think I get it... but everyone must've really enjoyed the movie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, good movie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm jealous... He spent a lifetime chasing a single idea. So courageous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, please. This stuff only ever happens in movies. Nobody would be so unrealistic in real life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take a guess. Why didn't the director give us a clear conclusion to his story?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everybody knows it in their hearts. He's walking into the mountains, the valleys, to the ends of the earth... He's just walking to a dead end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A dead end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You son of a mother... How could you say that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hm... I remember these two always bickering with each other...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(I'm getting a bad feeling about this...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They made the ending like this because they wanted us to fill in the rest ourselves. You can't figure even that out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you see nothing but a dead end ahead of him, then I can only feel sorry for how life's been treating you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph, I saw an irresponsible man and that's all. Maybe you're like him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If my kid grows up to be like him, I'll beat him 'till he can't leave town!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What? Wanna go? Let's do it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh-Why are they fighting all of a sudden?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Takes a deep breath)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop fighting—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spectating Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh! I knew we'd be treated to a wrestling match after the movie!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spectating Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, hold him down! Don't let him fight back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Spectating Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Quick, pass out the drinks I brought with me. It's time for the encore!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait... It wasn't supposed to go like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After the movie, it should've been..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Quit making trouble!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hyah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Broadcast Station Clerk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh... my arm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Furniture Factory Woodworker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Eek... My back..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, that's amazing... You stopped the two of them in one go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh*... You came back for a visit after so long, and these morons didn't change for even one bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's all okay... Everyone's always yelled at each other for as long as I can remember... Although today feels especially bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good thing you're still here, Uncle Fat Head. You took care of them so quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not just me. Your desserts helped, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Help me put the tape back in the cabinet by the wall, Warmy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "N-Nothing! I was just looking at how long the case says the movie is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So that was actually the full version..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha... Sounds like you don't like the movie's ending, either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "N-Not at all. I really like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The movie doesn't say... but I think the main character has already reached his goal and is ready to start a new journey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, that's just what I think... Even if everyone ends up fighting over what they think the ending is about... I think everyone's opinions are valid!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Silly girl... Why does it matter what anyone else thinks? What's important is what <i>you</i> think."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So why did you want to show a movie today, Warmy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I just wanted to get everyone together to have some fun... just like what Daddy used to do..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Every time he left home, he'd watch a movie with everybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He said... That's how you cheer everyone up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Warmy... You're all grown up now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can tell... You wanted to say a proper goodbye, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But things got so out of hand, I didn't get a chance..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, you know what? You've already said your goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When you invited all of us here, you told us what you've been through the last two years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can tell you've been taking care of yourself and made new friends... We all know. Just like the movie's main character, you've started a new journey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The most important thing is you're still young. You have all kinds of possibilities open to you. Do what it is that you want to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It doesn't matter if you want to stay here, keep looking for your old man, or something else..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All of us will support you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uncle Fat Head..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Silly girl. What's there to thank?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Town Projectionist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The next time you're back, we'll watch another movie together. How does that sound?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g5_rmbtwild_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mineral Transport Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here we are, girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mineral Transport Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You see the transport station up ahead? I hear they stopped running the last route to here not too long ago. Good thing the station hasn't been torn down, and the lights are still up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mineral Transport Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've got cargo to deliver, so I can't stay with you. Be careful out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks for the ride."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mineral Transport Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't mention it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mineral Transport Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are lots of rocks on the road here. Be careful and don't trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry. I've walked this path many, many times before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't fall down again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g6_rmbtmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl stops walking.\nAhead, the abandoned tracks are engulfed by the intense darkness. On the ground, a mining hard hat with a large conspicuous dent and a bent, misshapen valve handwheel lie forgotten.\nA mining lamp on the ground flickers repeatedly before suddenly losing its glimmer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I miss you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But... I'm going somewhere far, far away now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lanns says we're going even farther away than the transports go, and the Grinning Valley..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B-But you don't have to worry about me... Everyone'll be waiting for Warmy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young girl crosses into the loosely cordoned off area and walks toward the ruins.\nShe strokes the ice-cold surface of a rock, as though reminiscing that large, rough hand that she never once thought she would ever take her hand off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Daddy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warmy",
      "speakerId": "avg_4081_warmy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bye bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
